---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: All posts by biru25 about Arweave, AO, and the permaweb.
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="page-head">
    <span class="chip">Blog</span>
    <h1>All posts</h1>
    <p class="lead">Notes, tutorials, and experiments from the permaweb.</p>
</section>

<ul class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.post | reverse %}
        <li>
            <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-link">
                <span class="post-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
                <span class="post-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
                <span class="post-summary">{{ post.data.summary }}</span>
            </a>
        </li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>
